    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-art"><div class="about-disc" aria-hidden="true"></div><img src="/assets/images/raingirl.webp" alt="Blob’s ratgirl mascot in her yellow raincoat" width="1248" height="1856" /><span class="about-sticker" aria-hidden="true">hello, world.</span></div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="lead">Hey, I’m Blob.<br />You might know me as Mooshieblob.</p>
        <p>I’m a developer who likes making things for the web. I’m into frontend frameworks, creative layouts, and figuring out how to make an experience feel good to use.</p>
        <p>AI tools are another part of that curiosity. I experiment with images and build projects like <a href="https://mooshieui.mooshieblob.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MooshieUI</a>, a more approachable frontend for ComfyUI.</p>
        <p>Away from code, it’s usually games, anime, or another bit of tech that’s caught my attention. This site is where those interests end up together.</p>
        <div class="interest-line"><span>Web development</span><span>AI experiments</span><span>Games & anime</span></div>
        <div class="about-links"><a class="button primary" href="/images">See what I’ve been making ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Mooshieblob1/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
